<title>UK: Granada completes sale of Welcome Break.</title>
<headline>Granada completes sale of Welcome Break.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media firm Granada Group Plc said on Thursday it had completed its sale of Welcome Break Ltd to Bahrain-based Investcorp for 476 million stg.</p>
<p>The company announced last month the sale of Welcome Break, which provides motorway service areas in Britain.</p>
<p>Granada's shares rose 5.5p to 947.5 by 1445 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
